Studio REQ-STUDIO-TRUST-OWN-FOLDERS: folders Studio itself created open trusted, with no Workspace Trust modal.
Off unless the chat extension's default-off setting hypeproofChat.trustStudioFolders is on (it writes enabled=true into its globalState record).
Core trusts a local folder only when its real path is in that record (written by the extension when Studio creates the folder); every other folder prompts as upstream. Workspace trust stays enabled globally.
Hand-maintained: edit by applying to scripts/patches/core/upstream, then write git diff back under this header.

